        "Content": "Hume Auctioneers ? We Get The Pick Of The Crop\n\nSituated in one of Portlaoise?s best regarded addresses, this superbly completely refurbished 3-bedroom home offer an exceptional opportunity to acquire a quality family home in walk in condition with genuine room for expansion.\n\nTo the front, the property enjoys a smart, low-maintenance garden with off-street parking bound by a most attractive sliding gate on rollers. A neat lawn, boundary walls and an integral garage complete the attractive approach.\n\nA new composite door leads to a bright entrance hall with attractive tiling leads to a spacious, beautifully presented living room featuring modern flooring and a cosy solid-fuel stove.\nTo the rear is an impressive open-plan kitchen/dining room with extensive shaker-style cabinetry, generous worktop space, feature lighting and tiling. French doors provide excellent natural light and direct access to the garden. \n\nA useful utility area and adjoining garage complete this exceptionally clean and well-maintained ground floor.\n\nThe first floor is presented in immaculate, walk-in condition throughout. A bright landing leads to three beautifully maintained bedrooms, including a spacious principal bedroom with wardrobes, a comfortable second double bedroom and a well-proportioned single bedroom. Each room enjoys excellent natural light, contemporary flooring and a fresh, neutral décor.\nA stylish, fully tiled shower room completes the accommodation, featuring a large curved shower enclosure and modern sanitary ware. The exceptional presentation, cleanliness and quality finish evident throughout make this a truly turnkey home.\n\nThe generously sized rear garden is fully enclosed and exceptionally well maintained, featuring an extensive paved patio and a large, level lawn?ideal for children, outdoor dining and summer entertaining. Mature planting adds greenery and character.\n\nLiogard enjoys one of Portlaoise's most convenient and family-friendly locations, just a short stroll from the town centre and within easy reach of an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools. The development is only minutes walk from Portlaoise Train Station, offering frequent rail services to Dublin and beyond, while regular bus services and immediate access to the M7 motorway make commuting exceptionally convenient. Everyday shopping is well catered for with Portlaoise Shopping Centre, Tesco & Dunnes Stores, cafés and a wide range of local amenities all close by. Residents also benefit from excellent high-speed fibre broadband availability, making the area ideal for remote working. Combining superb connectivity with outstanding convenience, Liogard is a highly sought-after residential address that offers the perfect balance of town-centre living and a peaceful family environment.\n\nViewing Highly Recommended\n"
